      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in section 7 7-"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by inserting after the words \"any person\" the words \", other than a company to which subsection (1A) applies,\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: \"(1A) Every company shall for each year of assessment furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form within six months from the date following the close of the accounting period which constitutes the basis period for the year of assessment. (1B) Notwithstanding subsection (1A), where there is a change in the accounting period of a company such that the accounts are not closed on any date in a year, that company shall furnish a return in the prescribed form for that year and the year of assessment in which the accounts are closed within six months from the date following the close of the accounting period. (1c) For the purpose of subsection (1A), a return for a year of assessment shall - (a) specify the chargeable income and the amount of tax payable (if any) on that chargeable income for that year; and (b) contain such particulars as may be required by the Director General in respect of that company.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by inserting after the words \"Every person\" the words \", other than a company to which subsection (!A) applies,\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: \"(4) The Director General may allow a return to be furnished on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission. (5) For the purposes of subsection (4), the electronic medium to be used for the furnishing of returns and the software and hardware requirements for the electronic transmission of returns shall be as may be determined by the Director General.\". Amendment of section 80"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 80 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) Where the Director General exercises his powers under subsection (1), the occupiers of such lands, buildings and places shall provide the Director General or an authorized officer with all reasonable facilities and assistance for the exercise of his powers under this section.\". Amendment of section 90"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 90 of the principal Act is amended -"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words \"section 77\" the words \"section 77(1)\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: \"(!A) Where a company has furnished a return under section 77(1A) to the Director General for a year of assessment, the Director General shall be deemed to have made, on the day on which the return is furnished, an assessment in respect of that company in the amount of tax on the chargeable income, the tax and the chargeable income being the respective amounts as specified in the return. (lB) For the purposes of this Act - (a) the return shall be deemed to be a notice c assessment; and (b) the deemed notice of assessment shall be deeme to have been served on the company on the da on which the Director General is deemed t have made the assessment.\". Amendment of section 93"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 93 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words \"An assessment\" the words \", other than an assessment under section 90(lA),\". Amendment of section 96"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
